guide completionist-horde/attune-compound-key-h
title Krol'dok Compound Key (Krol'dok Stronghold key)
faction Horde
levels 41-41
category Dungeons
folder Completionist attunements and keys
zone Riverglades
pitch Krol'dok Compound Key: Opens the way into the upper area of Krol'dok Stronghold. Tunk, by the smithy near War Handler Ashka, drops the Krol'dok Moulding; Kreza Darkthorn in Rog'mar forges the key from it with 4 Thick Leather and 12 Iron Bars.
why Opens the way into the upper area of Krol'dok Stronghold. Tunk, by the smithy near War Handler Ashka, drops the Krol'dok Moulding; Kreza Darkthorn in Rog'mar forges the key from it with 4 Thick Leather and 12 Iron Bars.



